# Your tuesday night Fun Fix on the sunshine coast

Hi  everyone, Have you had your drum and dance fix this year yet? If not, your in luck....we have a new course starting next week March 10th. Another chance to get your Tuesday night fun fix is about to begin and we are asking YOU to come and join us! We also have a farewell, a welcome and make sure you scroll right to the bottom and watch the link "to put a smile on your face"...just a treat! Its been a fabulous start to the year with classes and workshops all around South East QLD, check out the rest of the newsletter for a little peek about what you can expect in 2015 and be sure to live everyday this month with a whole lot of fun and of course a little bit of quirk! :)

#### Links of interest?

Here are a few links that may interest those in the drum and dance world: [Bassidi Kone's Bwazan](http://bwazan-mali.com/ "Bassidi Kone's Bwazan") [Camp Fareta](https://www.facebook.com/groups/56117327086/) [E](https://www.facebook.com/groups/56117327086/)[pizo's drum and dance camp](http://africadrums.com.au/) - Keep watch for 2015 dates [Please watch this to put a smile on your face](https://www.facebook.com/video.php?v=439383706224458&set=vb.425837690912393&type=2&theater)
